// RenkuBASIC CLI test: a syntax error is reported, not ignored
// Derived from: yabasic 2.92.1 tests/error/error_string_not_terminated.yab
//
// Comparing a string with a number has no implicit conversion in yabasic, so
// this program must be rejected at compile time.

// @expect-exit: 1
// @expect-stderr-contains: syntax error

if "1" = 1 then
  print "unreachable"
endif
